     3941   Filter-Block:
     3942   DO ON STOP    UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     3943       ON ERROR   UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     3944       ON END-KEY UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block :
